---
title: Design class diagram 3 of 8 - supporting entities (Strategies.Api/Data/Models)
---
classDiagram
    direction LR

    class ChecklistTemplate {
        <<entity>>
        +Id: Guid «PK»
        +VisaCategoryId: Guid «FK VisaCategory»
        +DocumentTypeId: Guid «FK DocumentType»
        +IsMandatory: bool
    }
    class Message {
        <<entity>>
        +Id: Guid «PK»
        +CaseId: Guid «FK Case»
        +SenderId: Guid «FK User»
        +Body: string
        +IsRead: bool = false
        +SentAt: DateTime = UtcNow
    }
    class VisaRecord {
        <<entity>>
        +Id: Guid «PK»
        +CaseId: Guid «FK Case»
        +VisaType: string
        +IssuedDate: DateTime
        +ExpiryDate: DateTime
        +RenewalFlagged: bool = false
    }
    class AgentRun {
        <<entity>>
        +Id: Guid «PK»
        +CaseId: Guid? «FK Case»
        +LeadId: Guid? «FK Lead»
        +AgentType: AgentType
        +Output: string
        +Status: RunStatus
        +RanAt: DateTime = UtcNow
    }
    class AuditLog {
        <<entity>>
        +Id: Guid «PK»
        +UserId: Guid? «FK User»
        +Action: string
        +EntityType: string
        +EntityId: Guid
        +CreatedAt: DateTime = UtcNow
    }
    class VisaCategory {
        <<entity, see diagram 1>>
    }
    class DocumentType {
        <<entity, see diagram 2>>
    }
    class Case {
        <<entity, see diagram 1>>
    }
    class Lead {
        <<entity, see diagram 1>>
    }
    class User {
        <<entity, see diagram 1>>
    }

    VisaCategory "1" *-- "0..*" ChecklistTemplate
    DocumentType "1" *-- "0..*" ChecklistTemplate
    Case "1" *-- "0..*" Message
    User "1" <-- "0..*" Message : sender
    Case "1" *-- "0..*" VisaRecord
    Case "0..1" *-- "0..*" AgentRun
    Lead "0..1" <-- "0..*" AgentRun
    User "0..1" <-- "0..*" AuditLog : actor

    note "No methods: these are EF Core property classes.<br>AuditLog.EntityId points at a Case, Document, Lead or User<br>row by value (no foreign key).<br>Messages are listed and marked read as notifications,<br>but no endpoint creates one. AgentRun, VisaRecord and<br>ChecklistTemplate are never read or written by the API."
